* **Payment Rail Exposure:** Regional commercial bank subsidiaries and NOSTRO/VOSTRO payment channels face heightened exposure to credential theft and unauthorized payment injection. Attackers targeting regional clearinghouses utilize automated email filtering rules to delete confirmation alerts before deploying wipers to erase logs and obstruct recovery.



